                docs: [
                    "An iterator over the elements of another iterator that a predicate",
                    "accepts: the lazy form of [filter].",
                    "",
                    "```",
                    "let xs = List(1, 2, 3, 4)",
                    "for x in filtering(iter(xs), (x) -> x > 2) {",
                    "    println(\"${x}\")                                  // 3, then 4",
                    "}",
                    "```",
                    "",
                    "@param it    the source, which the adaptor takes over (see [detach])",
